1
00:00:00,839 --> 00:00:02,969
Nine times out of 10, no problem.

2
00:00:03,842 --> 00:00:07,632
- What happens on the 1 Oth time?
- Problem.

3
00:00:11,475 --> 00:00:14,935
(Howard:)Hey, guys, before I forget,
l got you a little groomsmen present.

4
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:16,435
(Dimitri(in Russian):)- Thanks.
- You didn't have to.

5
00:00:16,646 --> 00:00:21,276
Fantastic Four Annual Number 3
from 1965 in mint condition.

6
00:00:21,485 --> 00:00:24,945
(Howard:)The one where Mr. Fantastic
and the lnvisible Girl get married.

7
00:00:25,155 --> 00:00:26,405
(Leonard:)Oh, wow.

8
00:00:26,615 --> 00:00:28,535
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

9
00:00:29,868 --> 00:00:31,948
- l was afraid of this.
- What?

10
00:00:32,162 --> 00:00:35,622
(Sheldon:)While a thoughtful gift,
this comic book in this condition...

11
00:00:35,832 --> 00:00:39,122
- ...is worth at least $100.
- Yeah, so?

12
00:00:39,336 --> 00:00:43,176
l bought you and Bernadette
a gravy boat worth $88.

13
00:00:44,174 --> 00:00:48,134
(Sheldon:)Which places me in your debt,
and I can't be in your debt...

14
00:00:48,345 --> 00:00:51,515
(Sheldon:)...because someday,
you might ask me to help you move...

15
00:00:53,183 --> 00:00:56,523
(Sheldon:)...or to kill a man.

16
00:00:57,187 --> 00:00:59,477
(Leonard:)I doubt he'll ask you to kill a man.

17
00:00:59,689 --> 00:01:03,019
(Sheldon:)Well, what if it's his only way out?
I can't risk it.

